## Postman API Guide: Provisioning a New Business Tenant

To create a new subscriber business and admin user from Postman, send a `POST` request to:

**URL**: `http://localhost:3000/api/admin/tenants`  
**Header**: `Content-Type: application/json`

**Sample JSON Body**:
```json
{
  "businessName": "Sri Rama Areca Works",
  "businessEmail": "contact@sriramaareca.com",
  "phone": "9845012345",
  "address": "NH 66, Kundapura, Karnataka - 576201",
  "plan": "PRO",
  "adminName": "Rama Krishna",
  "adminEmail": "admin@sriramaareca.com",
  "adminPassword": "password123"
}
```

